    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present this bright and spacious four-bedroom residence, ideally located in the heart of the ever-popular seaside town of Kilkee. Situated just a short stroll from the town centre and the renowned horseshoe-shaped Kilkee Beach, this attractive property offers the perfect combination of comfort, convenience and coastal charm.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property extends over three floors and provides generous, well-proportioned accommodation designed to suit modern family living, holiday use or investment purposes. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a spacious open-plan kitchen/ dining area. To the rear is the large, spacious reception room, flooded with natural light and featuring patio doors opening onto a private enclosed rear garden, an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining or relaxing after a day by the sea. \r\n\r\nThe first floor accommodates two generous double bedrooms, one of which benefits from an ensuite bathroom, together with the main family bathroom. On the second floor are two further spacious double bedrooms, offering flexible accommodation suitable for family members or guests. \r\n\r\nThis superb property is ideally suited as a permanent family home, a coastal holiday retreat or an investment opportunity in one of County Clare's most desirable seaside destinations"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accomodation\r\n\r\nHall -Welcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring.\r\nReception Room – 5.12m x 4.59m\r\nBright and spacious reception room located to the rear of the property with french doors of to rear garden. \r\nKitchen / Dining Room – 4.09m x 3.29m Fitted kitchen with open plan dining area , creating an ideal space for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 – 4.24m x 3.41m\r\nSpacious and bright double bedroom located to the rear, fully carpeted and complete with ensuite and built in wardrobes.\r\nEnsuite – 2.47m x 1.50m with WC, WHB and shower.\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.80m x 3.14m Double bedroom to the front of the property, carpeted and built in wardrobes. \r\nBathroom – 2.06m x 1.9 main bathroom complete with WC, WHB, bath and overhead pump shower. \r\n\r\nSecond Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 3.69m x 3.4m spacious double room to rear, carpeted\r\nBedroom 4 – 3.36m x 2.95m spacious double room to front carpeted"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Additional Features\r\n\r\nBuilt circa: 1998\r\nElectric Heating \r\nMains water and sewage\r\nDouble-glazed PVC windows\r\nCarpets, curtains, blinds, light fittings & appliances inlcuded. \r\n\r\nOverall Floor Area\r\nApprox. 112.52sq. m. (1211.05sq. ft)"
      },
